  "body": "Set on a generous 619sqm section with approximately 239sqm of floor area, this home features five bedrooms, three bathrooms and two living areas, with a flexible layout that works beautifully for growing families, extended family living or those needing extra space to work from home.\r\n\r\n• 5 spacious bedrooms and 3 modern bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n• 2 separate living areas\r\n• Approx. 239sqm floor area on a 619sqm section\r\n• Granny potential with 2 bedrooms, a bathroom and a separate living area\r\n• Stylish designer kitchen with a large island bench\r\n• Walk-in scullery for extra storage and preparation space\r\n• Two outdoor entertaining areas\r\n• Central air conditioning unit for year-round comfort\r\n• 10-year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocated in Millwater, you are part of a family-friendly community. Local schools, parks, and cafes are all within easy reach, with easy access to the motorway.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
